---
import { ArrowRight, ShoppingBag, X } from '@lucide/astro';
const inCheckout = Astro.url.pathname.replace(/\/$/, '') === '/checkout';
---
<dialog class="cart-drawer" id="cart-drawer" aria-labelledby="cart-title">
  <div class="drawer-shell">
    <div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="cart-title">Tu bolsa</h2><form method="dialog"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Cerrar bolsa"><X size={23} /></button></form></div>
    <div class="drawer-empty" data-drawer-empty>
      <ShoppingBag size={37} stroke-width={1.25} aria-hidden="true" />
      <div><h3>Tu bolsa está vacía</h3><p>Encuentra una fragancia para tu próximo plan.</p></div>
      <a class="button primary" href="/#catalogo">Explorar perfumes <ArrowRight size={18} /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="drawer-items" data-drawer-items></div>
    <div class="drawer-footer" data-drawer-footer hidden>
      <div class="drawer-total"><span>Total en productos</span><strong data-drawer-total></strong></div>
      <p>Te confirmaremos el costo del envío antes del pago. El envío se paga por separado al transportista.</p>
      {inCheckout ? <><button class="button primary full-width" type="button" data-cart-continue>Volver a la solicitud <ArrowRight size={18} /></button><a class="button secondary full-width" href="/#catalogo">Seguir comprando</a></> :
        <><a href="/checkout" class="button primary full-width">Solicitar pedido <ArrowRight size={18} /></a><button class="button secondary full-width" type="button" data-cart-continue>Seguir comprando</button></>}
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>
<div class="cart-feedback" data-cart-feedback hidden>
  <p data-cart-feedback-copy></p>
  <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-cart-open>Ver bolsa</button>
</div>
<div class="sr-only" role="status" data-cart-status></div>
<script>
  import '../scripts/cart-ui';
</script>
